    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Andrew Beck",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107375202571469946969/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLO0tktQCxsJYXKQ9oFyVwYKb-RLlfyRInyJDF7ypq7mQQAog=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Alexandre was so amazing.AGAIN! This is the second time I’ve needed phone and internet help in the last two years and Alex killed it again. He was informative, knowledgeable, friendly, fast and effective. I couldn’t ask for a better experience. Respect and appreciation.",
        "time": 1768391258,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Apira Vigneshwaran",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108923471316840945405/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUJpN7xnusOg7S0t1cvjNuJmycPhBvvlUh7QFiE-hgxym-wfckz=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "We visited Costco on Black Friday and were assisted by Pablo. We’ve dealt with him in the past and he continues to impress with his knowledge and professionalism. He went above and beyond to ensure we got the best deal on our upgrade and plan. Thank you again for the amazing service, especially on such a busy and chaotic day!",
        "time": 1764359372,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tej Patel",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116020256948019321528/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJYD7VXrs0MvDBmYod48sRuPRslkc-dMv-H8HKhQeuKTA-U=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Alexandre gave me exceptional service at the Costco electronics/phone booth. He was patient, knowledgeable, and genuinely went above and beyond to help me. He took the time to explain everything clearly, answered all my questions, and made the whole process smooth and effortless. Employees like him truly make a difference. Highly recommend speaking to Alexandre if you need help and an amazing service!",
        "time": 1763996620,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Julie B",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111758365305340541839/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLsYsipnd87Y5cdOSFBjexlpdBKckUrAofpgS8U9mpV8o6llw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "We are with Roger’s for cells and cell plans, have been for over 20yrs probably. Went to Roger’s first because we are due to update plan and cells. They would not credit the 80$ fee per cell when everywhere else does it, did not offer any free gifts, nothing. Went to Costco phone booth on last day of Black Friday, and 1. The same plan was much cheaper 2. We got credited for the 80$ fee per cell 3. We each got 200$ credits at Costco 4. We got Apple care for 200$ for the two years (per cell) compared to Roger’s charging 19$ per month for 24 months.\nI am SO happy we went to Costco! And the salesperson was great as well, knowledgeable and polite. Pedro I think was his name. Thank you!!",
        "time": 1764606229,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alex Bedard",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108170628791034276364/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVDbI5Nx41hmBIoP-P0qGXg7s762wDJlh3Y2kgSkGwVSj_na9XK0Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Alexandre was exceptional, he was clear and extremely helpful, consumer friendly as well, going the extra mile to get us the best deal and even free gifts that he could get along with our new phones/plans. Thank you Alexandre !!",
        "time": 1767031204,
        "translated": false
      }
